{"sha": "8705d318aaa97ac526031e7f90f5f8ccd06bb901c2c7760d201938dd7ce5399a", "body": ["\\begin{definition}[单位根]\\label{def:b1:complex:unity}", "\\emph{$n$ 次单位根}\\index{单位根}是", "方程 $z^n = 1$ 的解：", "\\[", "\\mathbb{U}_n = \\bigl\\{\\, \\omega^k : k = 0, \\dots, n-1 \\,\\bigr\\},", "\\qquad \\omega = \\eu^{2\\iu\\pi/n}.", "\\]", "它们在乘法下构成群（见\\cref{ch:b1:structures}），", "且位于单位圆内接正 $n$ 边形的顶点上。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.5]", "  \\draw[->, thin] (-1.35,0) -- (1.45,0) node[below] {$\\Re$};", "  \\draw[->, thin] (0,-1.35) -- (0,1.45) node[left] {$\\Im$};", "  \\draw[thin, gray] (0,0) circle (1);", "  \\foreach \\k in {0,...,4} {", "    \\fill[omDef] ({cos(72*\\k)},{sin(72*\\k)}) circle (0.035);", "  }", "  \\draw[omDef, thick] (1,0) -- ({cos(72)},{sin(72)}) -- ({cos(144)},{sin(144)})", "    -- ({cos(216)},{sin(216)}) -- ({cos(288)},{sin(288)}) -- cycle;", "  \\node[right, font=\\small, omDef] at (1.02,0.12) {$1$};", "  \\node[above right, font=\\small, omDef] at ({cos(72)},{sin(72)})", "    {$\\omega$};", "  \\node[above left, font=\\small, omDef] at ({cos(144)},{sin(144)})", "    {$\\omega^2$};", "  \\node[below left, font=\\small, omDef] at ({cos(216)},{sin(216)})", "    {$\\omega^3$};", "  \\node[below right, font=\\small, omDef] at ({cos(288)},{sin(288)})", "    {$\\omega^4$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 五次单位根，$\\omega = \\eu^{2\\iu\\pi/5}$：单位圆上的", "正五边形。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[单位根之和]\\label{prop:b1:complex:sumroots}", "当 $n \\geq 2$ 时，$n$ 次单位根之和为零：", "$\\sum_{k=0}^{n-1} \\omega^k = 0$。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "公比 $\\omega \\neq 1$ 的等比求和：", "$\\sum_{k=0}^{n-1} \\omega^k = \\frac{\\omega^n - 1}{\\omega - 1} = 0$", "由于 $\\omega^n = 1$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{example}[读取实部与虚部]\\label{ex:b1:complex:sumrootsparts}", "将 $\\sum_{k=0}^{n-1}\\omega^k = 0$ 分为实部与", "虚部，可直接得到两个三角恒等式：", "\\[", "\\sum_{k=0}^{n-1}\\cos\\frac{2k\\pi}n = 0,", "\\qquad", "\\sum_{k=0}^{n-1}\\sin\\frac{2k\\pi}n = 0", "\\qquad (n \\geq 2).", "\\]", "从几何上看，单位圆内接正 $n$ 边形的重心", "即圆心 --- 各顶点恰好达到平衡。", "当 $n = 5$ 时，第一个恒等式给出 $1 + 2\\cos\\frac{2\\pi}5 +", "2\\cos\\frac{4\\pi}5 = 0$（将 $k$ 与 $n - k$ 配对），这正是", "\\cref{exo:b1:complex:8}中计算", "$\\cos\\frac{2\\pi}5$ 的出发点。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{example}[代数形式的平方根]\\label{ex:b1:complex:sqrt}", "不借助三角函数，求解 $z^2 = 3 + 4\\iu$，设 $z = x + \\iu y$：", "\\[", "x^2 - y^2 = 3, \\qquad 2xy = 4, \\qquad x^2 + y^2 = \\abs{3 + 4\\iu} = 5 .", "\\]", "将第一式与第三式相加得 $x^2 = 4$，于是 $x = \\pm 2$，再由 $y = 2/x =", "\\pm 1$，符号搭配须\\emph{相同}（$xy = 2 > 0$）：$z = \\pm(2 +", "\\iu)$。结合通常的求根公式，即可解出", "任意带复系数的二次方程", "（见\\cref{exo:b1:complex:7}）。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\section{复数与平面几何}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[几何对照]\\label{prop:b1:complex:geometry}", "将平面上的点 $M(x, y)$ 与其\\emph{复坐标} $z = x", "+ \\iu y$\\index{复坐标}。设 $A, B, C$ 为两两不同的点，其复坐标依次为 $a, b,", "c$：", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item $\\abs{b - a}$ 是 $AB$ 的距离；", "  \\item $\\arg\\dfrac{c - a}{b - a}$ 是向量", "        $\\vect{AB}$ 与 $\\vect{AC}$ 之间的夹角（模 $2\\pi$）；", "  \\item $A, B, C$ 共线当且仅当 $\\dfrac{c - a}{b - a} \\in", "        \\R$；直线 $AB$ 与 $AC$ 垂直当且仅当", "        $\\dfrac{c - a}{b - a} \\in \\iu\\R$。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "（1）是将模的定义用于 $b - a$，它是", "$\\vect{AB}$ 的复坐标。（2）：记 $b - a = r\\eu^{\\iu\\theta}$，$c - a =", "s\\eu^{\\iu\\varphi}$；则 $\\frac{c-a}{b-a} = \\frac sr", "\\eu^{\\iu(\\varphi - \\theta)}$ 的辐角为 $\\varphi - \\theta$，即", "由 $\\vect{AB}$ 到 $\\vect{AC}$ 的夹角。（3）：共线即夹角为 $0$", "或 $\\pi$，即辐角属于 $\\pi\\Z$，亦即商为实数；", "垂直即夹角为 $\\pm\\frac\\pi2$，亦即商", "为纯虚数。（由 $C \\neq A$，商非零。）", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{remark}[插曲：$\\C$ 是赋予了乘法的平面]\\label{rem:b1:complex:interlude}", "值得停下来想一想，本章究竟依赖什么才得以成立：", "平面 $\\R^2$ 在各个方向上都有加法，", "却没有天然的乘法 --- 而 $\\C$ \\emph{正是}", "装备了这样一种乘法的平面，在其中，乘以一个固定的数", "即旋转并伸缩。这一结构在本卷中还将", "被反复运用三次。在\\cref{ch:b1:matrices}中，乘以", "$a + \\iu b$ 再现为 $2 \\times 2$ 矩阵，其两行为 $(a,", "-b)$ 与 $(b, a)$：复数运算是第一族", "完全具体的矩阵乘积。在\\cref{ch:b1:euclid}中，", "公式 $\\Re(\\conj z\\,w)$ 恰为内积，", "而 $\\abs z$ 即欧几里得范数：本章证明的三角不等式", "正是那里柯西–施瓦茨不等式的原型。在", "\\cref{ch:b1:curves}中，动点最好写作 $t \\mapsto", "z(t)$，使速度与加速度成为复值", "导数 --- 例如圆周运动，就是简单地 $z(t) =", "R\\,\\eu^{\\iu\\omega t}$。一种好的乘法，带来四章的", "收益。", "\\end{remark}", ""]}